-- Specimen papers sourced from PhysicsAndMathsTutor and HEAD-verified
-- to return application/pdf. Each specimen becomes its own archive row
-- (session = 'Specimen') under the same topic/paper as the exam paper it
-- belongs to, so students can drill the specimen alongside the past papers.
--
-- Idempotent: a title/year/session that already exists is not inserted twice.

